    "$\\delta W(A)=\\frac1\\pi\\delta\\ln l\\cdot\\ln m$",
    "$l=-m^{-6}\\quad\\text{(trefoil)}$",
    "$A(l,m)=l-(m^4-m^2-2-m^{-2}+m^{-4})+l^{-1}\\quad\\text{(figure-eight)}$"
