      "section": "§4.1 (4.6)",
      "pages": [
        65,
        65
      ],
      "anchor": "A p.65 eq (4.6)",
      "quote": "The flow equation then becomes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A",
      "section": "§4.1 (4.8)",
      "pages": [
        66,
        66
      ],
      "anchor": "A p.66 eq (4.8)",
      "quote": "these equations can be put in a form with four-dimensional symmetry"
    },
    {
      "text": "A",
      "section": "§4.1 (4.13)",
      "pages": [
        67,
        67
      ],
      "anchor": "A p.67 eq (4.13)",
      "quote": "This is a consequence of the equations plus boundary conditions"
